OL,3,ABurnham addressing MPs in Commons for
OL,4,Afirst time since becoming PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is addressing the House of
OL,7,FCommons - and taking questions from MPs
OL,8,F- for the first time as prime minister.
OL,9,FWatch live at the top of the page
OL,11,FThe PM says his approach is "politics
OL,12,Fdone differently", as he acknowledges
OL,13,Fthat people are looking for
OL,14,F"substantial change"
OL,16,FSpeaking about changes made to the
OL,17,Fgovernment's early prisoner release
OL,18,Fscheme, Burnham says he has heard
OL,19,Fconcerns and the policy will "balance
OL,20,Fpublic safety and basic fairness"
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
