OL,3,ABurnham addressing MPs in Commons for
OL,4,Afirst time since becoming PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also pays tribute to his predecessor
OL,7,FKeir Starmer for a "lifetime of public
OL,8,Fservice", and pledges to continue his
OL,9,Fsupport for Ukraine
OL,11,FMeanwhile, UK borrowing costs have
OL,12,Frisen again - see the recent climbs
OL,13,Fhere. Downing Street insists "fiscal
OL,14,Fdiscipline is the bedrock of economic
OL,15,Fstability"
